        "custom_product_accordion_iGN3AG": {
          "type": "custom_product_accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Product information",
            "content_type": "text",
            "metafield_source": "none",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "step_1_title": "Tear open",
            "step_1_description": "a sealed mask — no prep",
            "step_2_title": "Loop it on",
            "step_2_description": "— ear loops keep it in place",
            "step_3_title": "Feel the cold",
            "step_3_description": "for 60+ minutes",
            "description": "Trusted by health practitioners, schools, athletes, and spas worldwide, with over one million cups sold.\n\nExperience professional-grade cupping therapy at its finest with the EDGE silicone cupping set. Featuring our exclusive FlexiPure silicone cups, this set delivers powerful suction with precise control, outperforming traditional glass, plastic, or bulky electric \"smart\" cups in both stationary and dynamic cupping techniques.\n\nYour Professional Set includes 1x Medium EDGE cup (2.5\"), (1) Large ZEN cup (2\"), and (1) Small ZEN cup (1.5\"), and a sleek travel/storage bag. The strategically sized cups ensure optimal coverage for all body areas and therapeutic needs.\n\nWidely used by physical therapists, massage therapists, and wellness practitioners, EDGE cups excel in myofascial release, joint mobility, and muscle recovery. The versatile set supports respiratory health through chest congestion relief, enhances immune function via lymphatic drainage, and even aids in body contouring and cellulite reduction. Perfect for professional practice or self-care at home, these cups deliver powerful results for pain relief, athletic recovery, and overall wellness maintenance."
          }
        },
        "accordion_tabcusto": {
          "type": "custom_product_accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Materials",
            "content_type": "text",
            "metafield_source": "none",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "step_1_title": "Tear open",
            "step_1_description": "a sealed mask — no prep",
            "step_2_title": "Loop it on",
            "step_2_description": "— ear loops keep it in place",
            "step_3_title": "Feel the cold",
            "step_3_description": "for 60+ minutes",
            "description": "Crafted with our exclusive FlexiPure silicone, EDGE cups represent the gold standard in cupping therapy:\n\n• Medical-grade, body-safe silicone\n• Free from BPA, BPS, phthalates, PVC, and latex\n• No harmful fillers or additives\n• Iconic transparent design for easy placement and monitoring\n• Durable, easy-to-clean material\n• Professional-grade construction"
          }
        },
        "accordion_0a71f30d": {
          "type": "custom_product_accordion",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "How To Use",
            "content_type": "text",
            "metafield_source": "none",
            "open_by_default": false,
            "step_1_title": "Tear open",
            "step_1_description": "a sealed mask — no prep",
            "step_2_title": "Loop it on",
            "step_2_description": "— ear loops keep it in place",
            "step_3_title": "Feel the cold",
            "step_3_description": "for 60+ minutes",
            "description": "Static (\"Parked\") Cupping: Apply cup to clean skin and leave in place for 3-5 minutes. Perfect for targeting specific areas and deep tissue work.\n\nDynamic (Massage) Cupping: Apply sufficient lubricant to clean skin for easy, frictionless gliding. Ideal for larger areas and promoting circulation.\n\nImportant Notes: Always apply cups to clean skin. Avoid direct placement over lymph nodes. For detailed instructions, professional tips, and contraindications, please refer to the cupping guide included with your set."
          }
        },
